   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi<br><br>Can a global variable be used in the conditional argument of conditionalPanel? If so, how do you do that? The following seems to simply ignore the condition and assume it is TRUE.<br><br>Thanks<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>abc </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE<br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$something </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;something&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  header</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  body</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dashboardBody</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    conditionalPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;abc&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      verbatimTextOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;something&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  title</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Test&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  skin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;blue&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
