    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The conditionpanel takes a javascript expression rather than an R expression as input.  It doesn&#39;t have access to your R variables.  It&#39;s usually used with input values because inputs are available both in Shiny (R) and in javascript.</div>"
    ],
    [
