le=\"color:#000\"><br>  header</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  body</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dashboardBody</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    conditionalPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;abc&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      verbatimTextOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;something&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  title</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Test&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  skin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;blue&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><br></div></blockquote></div>"
